list-item.p:
Fix X1, X2 ∈ {0,1}ℓ and
            Y ∈ {0,1}ℓ. Then Pr[π(X1) ⊕
            π(X2) = Y] = 1/(2ℓ − 1) if
            X1 ≠ X2 and Y ≠ 0ℓ;
            0 if X1 ≠ X2 and Y = 0ℓ;
            0 if X1 = X2 and Y ≠ 0ℓ;
            1 if X1 = X2 and Y = 0ℓ.

sec.p:
